---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<Layout title="Funding" description="How Peptide Rulebook is funded and our conflict-of-interest policy." canonical="/about/funding">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'About', href: '/about' }, { label: 'Funding', href: '/about/funding' }]} />
    <div class="py-10 prose prose-slate max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-[#1e293b]">Funding</h1>
      <p>Peptide Rulebook is an independent editorial project. We do not accept payment from peptide manufacturers, compounding pharmacies, or marketers to influence status conclusions.</p>
      <h2>Revenue sources</h2>
      <p>Current operations are funded by the project team. If we add paid memberships, grants, or sponsorships in the future, we will disclose them here and separate them from editorial decisions.</p>
      <h2>Conflict of interest</h2>
      <p>Contributors disclose relevant financial or professional relationships. We do not assign reviewers with a direct financial interest in the outcome of a status determination.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
